 136:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c **** 
 137:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****   /* DCT4 computation involves DCT2 (which is calculated using RFFT)
 138:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    * along with some pre-processing and post-processing.
 139:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    * Computational procedure is explained as follows:
 140:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    * (a) Pre-processing involves multiplying input with cos factor,
 141:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *     r(n) = 2 * u(n) * cos(pi*(2*n+1)/(4*n))
 142:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *              where,
 143:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                 r(n) -- output of preprocessing
 144:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                 u(n) -- input to preprocessing(actual Source buffer)
 145:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    * (b) Calculation of DCT2 using FFT is divided into three steps:
 146:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                  Step1: Re-ordering of even and odd elements of input.
 147:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                  Step2: Calculating FFT of the re-ordered input.
 148:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                  Step3: Taking the real part of the product of FFT output and weights.
 149:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    * (c) Post-processing - DCT4 can be obtained from DCT2 output using the following equation:
 150:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                   Y4(k) = Y2(k) - Y4(k-1) and Y4(-1) = Y4(0)
 151:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                        where,
 152:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    *                           Y4 -- DCT4 output,   Y2 -- DCT2 output
 153:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    * (d) Multiplying the output with the normalizing factor sqrt(2/N).
 154:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****    */
 155:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c **** 
 156:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****         /*-------- Pre-processing ------------*/
 157:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****   /* Multiplying input with cos factor i.e. r(n) = 2 * x(n) * cos(pi*(2*n+1)/(4*n)) */
 158:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_f32.c ****   arm_scale_f32(pInlineBuffer, 2.0f, pInlineBuffer, S->N);
  58              		.loc 1 158 3 view .LVU9
